<!--
  unarmed-monk.xml — golden fixture (task golden-fixtures; DESIGN §7.4 case: UNARMED).

  Intent: a level-1 Monk with NO weapon and NO active skill. This is the pure
  defensive/resource baseline of the §7.4 matrix — it exercises the life/mana/ES/
  spirit, armour/evasion, max-resist and effective-hit-pool calc paths with zero
  offensive contribution (no TotalDPS), so any drift in the defensive layer alone
  shows up here.

  Provenance (humanGate=gamedata): authored from the upstream save formats
  (Build:Save / TreeTab:Save), same method as fixtures/sample-build.xml. NO live
  scraping, NO bundled GGG assets. gamedata IDs used:
    - class: Monk  (PoB2 spec classId/classInternalId = 10)
  Tree starts empty (no allocated passives) so the build is fully deterministic.
-->
